      "bbox": {
        "l": 216.0,
        "t": 132.78601953125008,
        "r": 499.66799999999995,
        "b": 124.59873047605822
      },
      "content": "NOTICE: Do not use tools to remove or refit the Personality Module."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_1202",
      "reading_order": 1521,
      "section": "Removing the IO Board",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 248.64,
        "t": 734.58601953125,
        "r": 552.4170000000003,
        "b": 713.8983344167461
      },
      "content": "The IO Board extends over the width of the oven behind the front panel, above the cavity. It is mounted to the cavity frame."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_1203",
      "reading_order": 1522,
      "section": "Removing the IO Board",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 248.64,
        "t": 691.1460195312501,
        "r": 539.457,
        "b": 670.2153344167463
      },
      "content": "The IO board supplies the control voltages to the UI and switches the oven components as required."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_1204",
      "reading_order": 1523,
      "section": "Removing the IO Board",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 248.63999999999993,
        "t": 647.46601953125,
        "r": 554.937,
        "b": 626.5353344167462
      },
      "content": "Unused connections may require link connectors fitted, ensure positions are noted before removal of the board from the oven."
    },
